{"title":"1-Netty Reactor启动流程","uid":"9cc9cc6b479c617e396ded86e94ccb17","slug":"netty/1. Netty Reactor 启动流程","date":"2025-02-09T15:00:22.000Z","updated":"2025-03-30T13:05:52.248Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/netty/1. Netty Reactor 启动流程.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<h2 id=\"相关链接\"><a href=\"#相关链接\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关链接\"></a>相关链接</h2><p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/459313682\">详细图解Netty Reactor启动全流程 | 万字长文 | 多图预警</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_01.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"Netty-服务端的启动流程\"><a href=\"#Netty-服务端的启动流程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Netty 服务端的启动流程\"></a>Netty 服务端的启动流程</h2><ul>\n<li>创建服务端<code>NioServerSocketChannel</code>并初始化</li>\n<li>将服务端<code>NioServerSocketChannel</code>注册到<code>主Reactor线程组</code>中</li>\n<li>注册成功后，开始初始化<code>NioServerSocketChannel</code>中的 pipeline，然后在 pipeline 中触发 channelRegister 事件。</li>\n<li>随后由<code>NioServerSocketChannel</code>绑定端口地址。</li>\n<li>绑定端口地址成功后，向<code>NioServerSocketChannel</code>对应的<code>Pipeline</code>中触发传播<code>ChannelActive事件</code>，在<code>ChannelActive事件回调</code>中向<code>Main Reactor</code>注册<code>OP_ACCEPT事件</code>，开始等待客户端连接。服务端启动完成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_02.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"1-initAndRegister\"><a href=\"#1-initAndRegister\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. initAndRegister\"></a>1. initAndRegister</h2><p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_03.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<p>开始注册</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_04.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"2-Bind\"><a href=\"#2-Bind\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. Bind\"></a>2. Bind</h2><p><code>bind事件</code>在 Netty 中被定义为<code>outbound事件</code>，所以它在<code>pipeline</code>中是反向传播。先从<code>TailContext</code>开始反向传播直到<code>HeadContext</code>；<code>bind</code>的核心逻辑也正是实现在<code>HeadContext</code>中</p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>headContext 中的绑定方法</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_05.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>NioServerSocketChannel 中的绑定动作</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_06.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>绑定完成后触发 active 操作 –&gt; HeadContext</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_07.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>io.netty.channel.AbstractChannel.AbstractUnsafe#beginRead</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_08.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>io.netty.channel.nio.AbstractNioChannel#doBeginRead</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_09.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"细节点\"><a href=\"#细节点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"细节点\"></a>细节点</h2><h3 id=\"Reactor线程的启动是在向Reactor提交第一个异步任务的时候启动的\"><a href=\"#Reactor线程的启动是在向Reactor提交第一个异步任务的时候启动的\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Reactor线程的启动是在向Reactor提交第一个异步任务的时候启动的\"></a><code>Reactor线程</code>的启动是在向<code>Reactor</code>提交第一个异步任务的时候启动的</h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>io.netty.util.concurrent.SingleThreadEventExecutor#execute(java.lang.Runnable, boolean)</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_10.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"Reactor线程的核心工作-轮询所有注册其上的Channel中的IO就绪事件，处理对应Channel上的IO事件，执行异步任务\"><a href=\"#Reactor线程的核心工作-轮询所有注册其上的Channel中的IO就绪事件，处理对应Channel上的IO事件，执行异步任务\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Reactor线程的核心工作 轮询所有注册其上的Channel中的IO就绪事件，处理对应Channel上的IO事件，执行异步任务\"></a><code>Reactor</code>线程的核心工作 <code>轮询所有注册其上的Channel中的IO就绪事件</code>，<code>处理对应Channel上的IO事件</code>，<code>执行异步任务</code></h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>io.netty.channel.nio.NioEventLoop#run</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_11.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"Channel-的各种事件触发顺序\"><a href=\"#Channel-的各种事件触发顺序\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Channel 的各种事件触发顺序\"></a>Channel 的各种事件触发顺序</h3><ol>\n<li><p>handlerAdded</p>\n<p> socket 向 jdk selector 注册后、在通知注册的 promise 完成之前（也就是 promise 回调之前）触发</p>\n<p> <img src=\"/images/netty_01_12.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>channelRegistered</p>\n<p> 在通知 promise 完成后（也就是回调执行完成之后）会传播 Registered 事件</p>\n<p> <img src=\"/images/netty_01_13.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Active </p>\n<p>a. 服务端 NioServerSocketChannel 判断是否激活的标准为端口是否绑定成功。</p>\n<p>b. </p>\n<figure class=\"shiki java\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">public</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">class</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #FFCB6B\">NioServerSocketChannel</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">extends</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #FFCB6B\">AbstractNioMessageChannel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">                             </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">implements</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> io.netty.channel.socket.</span><span style=\"color: #FFCB6B\">ServerSocketChannel</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">@</span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">public</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">boolean</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">isActive</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">()</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">        </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">return</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">isOpen</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">()</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">javaChannel</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">().</span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">socket</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">().</span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">isBound</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<p>c. 客户端<code>NioSocketChannel</code>判断是否激活的标准为是否处于<code>Connected状态</code>。</p>\n<p>d. </p>\n   <figure class=\"shiki java\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">@</span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">public</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">boolean</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">isActive</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">()</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #C792EA\">SocketChannel</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> ch </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">javaChannel</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #BABED8\">    </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF; font-style: italic\">return</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> ch</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">.</span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">isOpen</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">()</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> </span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color: #BABED8\"> ch</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">.</span><span style=\"color: #82AAFF\">isConnected</span><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #89DDFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<p> e. 向后传播 active 事件<br> f. <code>readIfIsAutoRead</code></p>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>如果开启了自动读（io.netty.channel.ChannelConfig#isAutoRead），则注册对应感兴趣的事件</p></blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>server 连接注册 OP_ACCEPT 事件</li>\n<li>client 连接注册 OP_READ 事件</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"向底层-selector-注册\"><a href=\"#向底层-selector-注册\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"向底层 selector 注册\"></a>向底层 selector 注册</h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>io.netty.channel.nio.AbstractNioChannel#doRegister</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_14.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"NioServerSocketChannel-注册成功后回调任务进行端口绑定，会将端口绑定封装为一个任务提交到队列中，而不是即刻执行\"><a href=\"#NioServerSocketChannel-注册成功后回调任务进行端口绑定，会将端口绑定封装为一个任务提交到队列中，而不是即刻执行\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"NioServerSocketChannel 注册成功后回调任务进行端口绑定，会将端口绑定封装为一个任务提交到队列中，而不是即刻执行\"></a>NioServerSocketChannel 注册成功后回调任务进行端口绑定，会将端口绑定封装为一个任务提交到队列中，而不是即刻执行</h3><p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_15.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"事件在pipeline中的传播\"><a href=\"#事件在pipeline中的传播\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"事件在pipeline中的传播\"></a>事件在<code>pipeline</code>中的传播</h3><ul>\n<li><code>inbound事件</code>从<code>HeadContext</code>开始逐个向后传播直到<code>TailContext</code></li>\n<li><code>outbound事件</code>则是反向传播，从<code>TailContext</code>开始反向向前传播直到<code>HeadContext</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_16.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"服务端-Socket-和客户端-Socket-分别在何时向-seletor-注册感兴趣的事件？\"><a href=\"#服务端-Socket-和客户端-Socket-分别在何时向-seletor-注册感兴趣的事件？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"服务端 Socket 和客户端 Socket 分别在何时向 seletor 注册感兴趣的事件？\"></a>服务端 Socket 和客户端 Socket 分别在何时向 seletor 注册感兴趣的事件？</h3><ul>\n<li>注册感兴趣的事件触发时机都是<code>ChannelActive</code><ul>\n<li><img src=\"/images/netty_01_17.png\" alt=\"netty\"></li>\n<li>对于服务端 socket 来说，bind 成功后会传递 <code>channelActive</code>事件</li>\n<li>io.netty.channel.AbstractChannel.AbstractUnsafe#bind</li>\n<li><img src=\"/images/netty_01_18.png\" alt=\"netty\"></li>\n<li>对于客户端 socket 来说，register 成功后会传递 <code>channelActive</code>事件</li>\n<li>io.netty.channel.AbstractChannel.AbstractUnsafe#register0</li>\n<li><img src=\"/images/netty_01_19.png\" alt=\"netty\"></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>通过 <code>HeadContext#read</code> 方法进行感兴趣事件的注册</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><figure class=\"shiki\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">io.netty.channel.AbstractChannel.AbstractUnsafe#beginRead</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_20.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>io.netty.channel.nio.AbstractNioChannel#doBeginRead</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/images/netty_01_21.png\" alt=\"netty\"></p>\n","text":"相关链接详细图解Netty Reactor启动全流程 | 万字长文 | 多图预警 Netty 服务端的启动流程 创建服务端NioServerSocketChan...","permalink":"/post/netty/1. Netty Reactor 启动流程","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.6k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"Netty","slug":"Netty","count":5,"path":"api/categories/Netty.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Netty","slug":"Netty","count":5,"path":"api/tags/Netty.json"},{"name":"源码解析","slug":"源码解析","count":5,"path":"api/tags/源码解析.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5\"><span class=\"toc-text\">相关链接</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Netty-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%AB%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Netty 服务端的启动流程</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#1-initAndRegister\"><span class=\"toc-text\">1. initAndRegister</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#2-Bind\"><span class=\"toc-text\">2. Bind</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E7%BB%86%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9\"><span class=\"toc-text\">细节点</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Reactor%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%91Reactor%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%9A%84\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Reactor线程的启动是在向Reactor提交第一个异步任务的时候启动的</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Reactor%E7%BA